  "body": "Positioned alongside Kennedy Park in sought-after Castor Bay, 123 Beach Road is a beautifully refurbished four-bedroom, 3.5 bathroom residence combining sophisticated design, generous family living and exceptional indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nThe entry level offers excellent separation with a generous double bedroom and bathroom, alongside a dedicated media room/third lounge with integrated server cupboard and bespoke wine room, ideal for guests, teenagers or extended family. A striking timber staircase with stone detailing and a full height window leads to the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nHere, you will find an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area connect with a separate lounge opening effortlessly to a private courtyard with a built in bbq and sleek lap pool, creating an exceptional space for both entertaining and everyday living. Fully integrated smart-home technology puts complete control of the home at your fingertips, with virtually everything able to be operated from your phone or via touchscreen control panels positioned throughout the residence.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a versatile office or library accompanies three bedrooms. The master suite is a private retreat with its own deck, walk-in wardrobe and luxurious ensuite with spa bath and shower, while two further bedrooms share a beautifully appointed bathroom.\r\n\r\nRecently refreshed with a refurbished pool, fresh paint, new carpet and feature solid timber flooring, the home is ready to enjoy. Triple garaging, additional off-street parking and direct access to Kennedy Park complete the offering.\r\n\r\nMoments from Milford, Takapuna and Campbells Bay, and zoned for Westlake Boys’ and Girls’ High Schools and Campbells Bay Primary, this is an exceptional family home offering space, privacy, technology and lifestyle in a prized coastal location.\r\n\r\nA premium coastal offering where every detail has been carefully considered",
